  "protocol": "Each process ran alone on Metal with a fresh slot, identical eight-input/eight-output warmup then the uncached 912-ID handover and 64 real greedy tokens. Context and logical batch 4096, configured microbatch 8, compact Q4_0 DFlash2 with BF16 selectors, draft depth three and draft microbatch 128. All generated IDs compared offline, with one token in the first stream event. TTFT and last-token time from HTTP send. Decode TPS counts the 63 intervals after token one. File cache uncontrolled. Two candidate runs bracket a control on the same binary; neither timer profiler nor shape logging in these three runs.",
